@startuml editor_state_diagram

left to right direction

' State diagram showing which window opens with each action

[*] --> Editormenu
Editormenu --> [*] : Exit

Editormenu : UI -> editormenu.ui
Editormenu --> Editor       : Create
Editormenu --> SelectCircuit: Editor

Editor : UI -> editor.ui
Editor --> Editormenu   : Exit
Editor --> Creador         : Select a city

SelectCircuit : UI -> selectcircuit.ui
SelectCircuit --> Creador : Select a create circuit
SelectCircuit --> Editormenu: Exit

Creador : UI -> creador.ui
Creador --> Editormenu     : Done / Exit

@enduml
